{"id":"d0faa5e1a984aebe","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-internal-rational-numbers.md","title":"Definition — 自然数对象的有理分式商与严格序","display":"Definition — 自然数对象的有理分式商与严格序","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-internal-rational-numbers","aliases":["14-df-internal-rational-numbers"],"display":"Definition — 自然数对象的有理分式商与严格序","depends_on":["[[14-df-natural-numbers-object]]","[[14-df-nno-arithmetic]]","[[14-thm-nno-induction]]","[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]","[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]","[[14-df-power-object-membership]]","[[14-df-kernel-pairs-and-effective-equivalence-relations]]","[[14-thm-effective-quotient]]","[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]","[[14-df-isomorphism]]"],"source_status":"按附件中内部 Dedekind 实数所需的有理数参数补全；未重新核验原书。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-internal-rational-numbers"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-internal-rational-numbers</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 自然数对象的有理分式商与严格序"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8ee22b56cc1189dc\" href=\"?note=8ee22b56cc1189dc\" title=\"14-df-natural-numbers-object\">14-df-natural-numbers-object</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3d748c1ba1b93208\" href=\"?note=3d748c1ba1b93208\" title=\"14-df-nno-arithmetic\">14-df-nno-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"72d2de02f3f75f65\" href=\"?note=72d2de02f3f75f65\" title=\"14-thm-nno-induction\">14-thm-nno-induction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b51ff4f43221971d\" href=\"?note=b51ff4f43221971d\" title=\"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image\">14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f6ccc7c06d940d91\" href=\"?note=f6ccc7c06d940d91\" title=\"14-df-power-object-membership\">14-df-power-object-membership</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2835ef59873188e3\" href=\"?note=2835ef59873188e3\" title=\"14-df-kernel-pairs-and-effective-equivalence-relations\">14-df-kernel-pairs-and-effective-equivalence-relations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"934c77a59cf8de6f\" href=\"?note=934c77a59cf8de6f\" title=\"14-thm-effective-quotient\">14-thm-effective-quotient</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4cd3b0d29b80beda\" href=\"?note=4cd3b0d29b80beda\" title=\"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity\">14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"按附件中内部 Dedekind 实数所需的有理数参数补全；未重新核验原书。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯，选定终对象、二元积及投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{A,B}:A\\times B\\to A\">\\(p_{A,B}:A\\times B\\to A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{A,B}:A\\times B\\to B\">\\(q_{A,B}:A\\times B\\to B\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(N,z,s)\">\\((N,z,s)\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8ee22b56cc1189dc\" href=\"?note=8ee22b56cc1189dc\" title=\"14-df-natural-numbers-object\">14-df-natural-numbers-object</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathcal E}(N,z,s)\">\\(\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathcal E}(N,z,s)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_N,\\times_N:N\\times N\\to N\">\\(+_N,\\times_N:N\\times N\\to N\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"3d748c1ba1b93208\" href=\"?note=3d748c1ba1b93208\" title=\"14-df-nno-arithmetic\">14-df-nno-arithmetic</a> 在该零与后继结构上构造的两条箭头。所有以下带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 下标的构造同时依赖已经固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E,z,s\">\\(\\mathcal E,z,s\\)</span> 及积选择。</p>\n<p>像子对象、子对象拉回、等价关系和同构采用所列依赖；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eq}_A\">\\(\\operatorname{Eq}_A\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"f6ccc7c06d940d91\" href=\"?note=f6ccc7c06d940d91\" title=\"14-df-power-object-membership\">14-df-power-object-membership</a> 的对角子对象。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,B,d_i,a_i,b_i,L,R,E_N,T_N\">\\(D,B,d_i,a_i,b_i,L,R,E_N,T_N\\)</span> 由 Assertion 定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,R:B\\to N\">\\(L,R:B\\to N\\)</span> 是箭头名称。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 为候选对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:D\\to Q\">\\(q:D\\to Q\\)</span> 为候选箭头，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Q\\times Q)\">\\(O\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Q\\times Q)\\)</span> 为候选严格序子对象。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RatPres}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}\">\\(\\operatorname{RatPres}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}\\)</span> 同时记录商箭头与序，而不把任意稠密无端点线序称为有理数对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\ell_N\\coloneqq\\left\\langle p_{N,N},+_N\\circ\\langle p_{N,N},s\\circ q_{N,N}\\rangle\\right\\rangle:N\\times N\\to N\\times N,\\qquad\nO_N\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Im}(\\ell_N),\\\\\nD\\coloneqq(N\\times N)\\times N,\\qquad B\\coloneqq D\\times D,\\\\\nd_1\\coloneqq p_{N,N}\\circ p_{N\\times N,N},\\quad\nd_2\\coloneqq q_{N,N}\\circ p_{N\\times N,N},\\quad\nd_3\\coloneqq q_{N\\times N,N},\\\\\na_i\\coloneqq d_i\\circ p_{D,D},\\qquad b_i\\coloneqq d_i\\circ q_{D,D}\\quad(i\\in\\{1,2,3\\}),\\\\\nL\\coloneqq+_N\\circ\\left\\langle\\times_N\\circ\\langle a_1,s\\circ b_3\\rangle,\\times_N\\circ\\langle b_2,s\\circ a_3\\rangle\\right\\rangle,\\\\\nR\\coloneqq+_N\\circ\\left\\langle\\times_N\\circ\\langle b_1,s\\circ a_3\\rangle,\\times_N\\circ\\langle a_2,s\\circ b_3\\rangle\\right\\rangle,\\\\\nE_N\\coloneqq\\langle L,R\\rangle^{-1}(\\operatorname{Eq}_N),\\qquad\nT_N\\coloneqq\\langle L,R\\rangle^{-1}(O_N).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\ell_N\\coloneqq\\left\\langle p_{N,N},+_N\\circ\\langle p_{N,N},s\\circ q_{N,N}\\rangle\\right\\rangle:N\\times N\\to N\\times N,\\qquad\nO_N\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Im}(\\ell_N),\\\\\nD\\coloneqq(N\\times N)\\times N,\\qquad B\\coloneqq D\\times D,\\\\\nd_1\\coloneqq p_{N,N}\\circ p_{N\\times N,N},\\quad\nd_2\\coloneqq q_{N,N}\\circ p_{N\\times N,N},\\quad\nd_3\\coloneqq q_{N\\times N,N},\\\\\na_i\\coloneqq d_i\\circ p_{D,D},\\qquad b_i\\coloneqq d_i\\circ q_{D,D}\\quad(i\\in\\{1,2,3\\}),\\\\\nL\\coloneqq+_N\\circ\\left\\langle\\times_N\\circ\\langle a_1,s\\circ b_3\\rangle,\\times_N\\circ\\langle b_2,s\\circ a_3\\rangle\\right\\rangle,\\\\\nR\\coloneqq+_N\\circ\\left\\langle\\times_N\\circ\\langle b_1,s\\circ a_3\\rangle,\\times_N\\circ\\langle a_2,s\\circ b_3\\rangle\\right\\rangle,\\\\\nE_N\\coloneqq\\langle L,R\\rangle^{-1}(\\operatorname{Eq}_N),\\qquad\nT_N\\coloneqq\\langle L,R\\rangle^{-1}(O_N).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall e\\in E_N\\quad\\operatorname{IsEquivalenceRelation}\\left(\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal E}(e),p_{D,D}\\circ e,q_{D,D}\\circ e,D\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall e\\in E_N\\quad\\operatorname{IsEquivalenceRelation}\\left(\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal E}(e),p_{D,D}\\circ e,q_{D,D}\\circ e,D\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FracQuot}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nQ\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\land q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(D,Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{IsEpi}_{\\mathcal E}(q)\\land(q\\times q)^{-1}(\\operatorname{Eq}_Q)=E_N,\\\\\n\\operatorname{RatPres}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q,O)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{FracQuot}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land O\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Q\\times Q)\\land(q\\times q)^{-1}(O)=T_N.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FracQuot}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nQ\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\land q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(D,Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{IsEpi}_{\\mathcal E}(q)\\land(q\\times q)^{-1}(\\operatorname{Eq}_Q)=E_N,\\\\\n\\operatorname{RatPres}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q,O)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{FracQuot}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land O\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Q\\times Q)\\land(q\\times q)^{-1}(O)=T_N.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(D,Q)\\quad\\operatorname{FracQuot}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(D,Q)\\quad\\operatorname{FracQuot}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(D,Q)\\quad\n\\left(\\operatorname{FracQuot}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q)\\Rightarrow\n\\exists!O\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Q\\times Q)\\ \\operatorname{RatPres}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q,O)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(D,Q)\\quad\n\\left(\\operatorname{FracQuot}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q)\\Rightarrow\n\\exists!O\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Q\\times Q)\\ \\operatorname{RatPres}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q,O)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall Q,Q&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(D,Q)\\ \\forall q&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(D,Q&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;\\forall O\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Q\\times Q)\\ \\forall O&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Q&#39;\\times Q&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl(\\operatorname{RatPres}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q,O)\\land\\operatorname{RatPres}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q&#39;,q&#39;,O&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\Rightarrow\\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Q,Q&#39;)\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal E}(u)\\land u\\circ q=q&#39;\\land(u\\times u)^{-1}(O&#39;)=O\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall Q,Q&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(D,Q)\\ \\forall q&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(D,Q&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;\\forall O\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Q\\times Q)\\ \\forall O&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Q&#39;\\times Q&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl(\\operatorname{RatPres}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q,O)\\land\\operatorname{RatPres}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q&#39;,q&#39;,O&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\Rightarrow\\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Q,Q&#39;)\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal E}(u)\\land u\\circ q=q&#39;\\land(u\\times u)^{-1}(O&#39;)=O\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在内部算术记号中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 的三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b,c)\">\\((a,b,c)\\)</span> 表示分式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a-b)/(c+1)\">\\((a-b)/(c+1)\\)</span>。两个三元组的交叉乘积相等恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_N\">\\(E_N\\)</span>；交叉乘积的严格比较恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_N\">\\(T_N\\)</span>。这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c+1\">\\(c+1\\)</span> 由后继 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 表达，没有在初等拓扑斯中预设外部可数余积、整数对象、除法或分式域。</p>\n<p>自然数对象的参数递归和子对象归纳给出加乘交换、结合、分配及消去律，并给出严格序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&lt;m\\iff\\exists k\\ (n+s(k)=m)\">\\(n&lt;m\\iff\\exists k\\ (n+s(k)=m)\\)</span>。这些等式说明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_N\">\\(E_N\\)</span> 反身、对称、传递；正分母的乘法消去说明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_N\">\\(T_N\\)</span> 在两个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_N\">\\(E_N\\)</span> 等价类中均不依赖代表。有效商给出满射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>，其核对为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_N\">\\(E_N\\)</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_N\">\\(T_N\\)</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\times q\">\\(q\\times q\\)</span> 的像便得到下降的序子对象；代表不变性给出所列拉回等式，满射消去保证它唯一。</p>\n<p>两个表示的商箭头具有同一核对和余等化泛性质，所以有唯一与商箭头相容的同构。序的拉回等式与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\times q\">\\(q\\times q\\)</span> 的满性再给出序相容性。因而后续 Dedekind 截使用的是这个有理分式商的序，不能只凭稠密线序公理把任意输入对象代入为有理数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-natural-numbers-object","status":"resolved","id":"8ee22b56cc1189dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-numbers-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-nno-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"3d748c1ba1b93208","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-nno-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-nno-induction","status":"resolved","id":"72d2de02f3f75f65","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-induction]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products","status":"resolved","id":"1044b7940aaa4f1f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image","status":"resolved","id":"b51ff4f43221971d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-power-object-membership","status":"resolved","id":"f6ccc7c06d940d91","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-power-object-membership]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-kernel-pairs-and-effective-equivalence-relations","status":"resolved","id":"2835ef59873188e3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-kernel-pairs-and-effective-equivalence-relations]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-effective-quotient","status":"resolved","id":"934c77a59cf8de6f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-effective-quotient]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity","status":"resolved","id":"4cd3b0d29b80beda","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-numbers-object","status":"resolved","id":"8ee22b56cc1189dc","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，选定终对象、二元积及投影 $p_{A,B}:A\\times B\\to A$、$q_{A,B}:A\\times B\\to B$。$(N,z,s)$ 满足 [[14-df-natural-numbers-object]] 的 $\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathcal E}(N,z,s)$；$+_N,\\times_N:N\\times N\\to N$ 为 [[14-df-nno-arithmetic]] 在该零与后继结构上构造的两条箭头。所有以下带 $N$ 下标的构造同时依赖已经固定的 $\\mathcal E,z,s$ 及积选择。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-nno-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"3d748c1ba1b93208","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，选定终对象、二元积及投影 $p_{A,B}:A\\times B\\to A$、$q_{A,B}:A\\times B\\to B$。$(N,z,s)$ 满足 [[14-df-natural-numbers-object]] 的 $\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathcal E}(N,z,s)$；$+_N,\\times_N:N\\times N\\to N$ 为 [[14-df-nno-arithmetic]] 在该零与后继结构上构造的两条箭头。所有以下带 $N$ 下标的构造同时依赖已经固定的 $\\mathcal E,z,s$ 及积选择。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-power-object-membership","status":"resolved","id":"f6ccc7c06d940d91","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"像子对象、子对象拉回、等价关系和同构采用所列依赖；$\\operatorname{Eq}_A$ 是 [[14-df-power-object-membership]] 的对角子对象。$D,B,d_i,a_i,b_i,L,R,E_N,T_N$ 由 Assertion 定义；$L,R:B\\to N$ 是箭头名称。$Q$ 为候选对象，$q:D\\to Q$ 为候选箭头，$O\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Q\\times Q)$ 为候选严格序子对象。$\\operatorname{RatPres}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}$ 同时记录商箭头与序，而不把任意稠密无端点线序称为有理数对象。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"p_{A,B}:A\\times B\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"q_{A,B}:A\\times B\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"(N,z,s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathcal E}(N,z,s)","display":false},{"tex":"+_N,\\times_N:N\\times N\\to N","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E,z,s","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Eq}_A","display":false},{"tex":"D,B,d_i,a_i,b_i,L,R,E_N,T_N","display":false},{"tex":"L,R:B\\to N","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"q:D\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"O\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Q\\times Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RatPres}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\ell_N\\coloneqq\\left\\langle p_{N,N},+_N\\circ\\langle p_{N,N},s\\circ q_{N,N}\\rangle\\right\\rangle:N\\times N\\to N\\times N,\\qquad\nO_N\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Im}(\\ell_N),\\\\\nD\\coloneqq(N\\times N)\\times N,\\qquad B\\coloneqq D\\times D,\\\\\nd_1\\coloneqq p_{N,N}\\circ p_{N\\times N,N},\\quad\nd_2\\coloneqq q_{N,N}\\circ p_{N\\times N,N},\\quad\nd_3\\coloneqq q_{N\\times N,N},\\\\\na_i\\coloneqq d_i\\circ p_{D,D},\\qquad b_i\\coloneqq d_i\\circ q_{D,D}\\quad(i\\in\\{1,2,3\\}),\\\\\nL\\coloneqq+_N\\circ\\left\\langle\\times_N\\circ\\langle a_1,s\\circ b_3\\rangle,\\times_N\\circ\\langle b_2,s\\circ a_3\\rangle\\right\\rangle,\\\\\nR\\coloneqq+_N\\circ\\left\\langle\\times_N\\circ\\langle b_1,s\\circ a_3\\rangle,\\times_N\\circ\\langle a_2,s\\circ b_3\\rangle\\right\\rangle,\\\\\nE_N\\coloneqq\\langle L,R\\rangle^{-1}(\\operatorname{Eq}_N),\\qquad\nT_N\\coloneqq\\langle L,R\\rangle^{-1}(O_N).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall e\\in E_N\\quad\\operatorname{IsEquivalenceRelation}\\left(\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal E}(e),p_{D,D}\\circ e,q_{D,D}\\circ e,D\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FracQuot}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\nQ\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\land q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(D,Q)\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{IsEpi}_{\\mathcal E}(q)\\land(q\\times q)^{-1}(\\operatorname{Eq}_Q)=E_N,\\\\\n\\operatorname{RatPres}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q,O)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{FracQuot}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q)\\\\\n&\\land O\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Q\\times Q)\\land(q\\times q)^{-1}(O)=T_N.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(D,Q)\\quad\\operatorname{FracQuot}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(D,Q)\\quad\n\\left(\\operatorname{FracQuot}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q)\\Rightarrow\n\\exists!O\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Q\\times Q)\\ \\operatorname{RatPres}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q,O)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\forall Q,Q'\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(D,Q)\\ \\forall q'\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(D,Q')\\\\\n&\\forall O\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Q\\times Q)\\ \\forall O'\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Q'\\times Q')\\\\\n&\\quad\\bigl(\\operatorname{RatPres}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,q,O)\\land\\operatorname{RatPres}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q',q',O')\\\\\n&\\qquad\\Rightarrow\\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Q,Q')\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal E}(u)\\land u\\circ q=q'\\land(u\\times u)^{-1}(O')=O\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"(a,b,c)","display":false},{"tex":"(a-b)/(c+1)","display":false},{"tex":"E_N","display":false},{"tex":"T_N","display":false},{"tex":"c+1","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"n<m\\iff\\exists k\\ (n+s(k)=m)","display":false},{"tex":"E_N","display":false},{"tex":"T_N","display":false},{"tex":"E_N","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"E_N","display":false},{"tex":"T_N","display":false},{"tex":"q\\times q","display":false},{"tex":"q\\times q","display":false}],"bytes":5533,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-216","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-internal-rational-numbers|Definition — 自然数对象的有理分式商与严格序]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-311","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-internal-rational-numbers]]"},{"id":"7780fb047a21abcf","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，固定终对象 $1_{\\mathcal E}$、分类子 $(\\Omega,t)$、二元积与指数，并指定自然数对象 $(N,z,s)$；所引用的递归空积均取同一终对象 $1_{\\mathcal E}$。取 [[14-df-internal-rational-numbers]] 的有理分式商数据：对象 $Q$、箭头 $\\varpi:(N\\times N)\\times N\\to Q$ 和子对象 $O\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Q\\times Q)$，满足 $\\operatorname{RatPres}_{\\mathcal E;N,z,s}(Q,\\varpi,O)$；$o:O_Q\\hookrightarrow Q\\times Q$ 为 $O$ 的单态射代表，$[o]=O$。本条固定 $\\mathbb Q_{\\mathcal E}=Q$，截构造只使用这个有理数对象及其序。"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-217","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-internal-rational-numbers|Definition — 自然数对象的有理分式商与严格序]]"},{"id":"1cbcddc9f0a3bcfb","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"分式映射将局部常值自然数函数三元组送到局部常值有理数函数，且与限制相容。每个有理数都具有此种正分母分式表示；在局部常值的开纤维上选取该表示，得到 $q_X$ 的局部满性。交叉乘积相等及严格比较逐点给出有理表示谓词的两条拉回等式。因此常层 $Q_X$ 是已定义有理分式商的一个表示；若另选商对象，则须使用 [[14-df-internal-rational-numbers]] 的唯一序同构运输，不能默认为对象相等。"}],"outgoing":["8ee22b56cc1189dc","3d748c1ba1b93208","72d2de02f3f75f65","1044b7940aaa4f1f","b51ff4f43221971d","f6ccc7c06d940d91","2835ef59873188e3","934c77a59cf8de6f","4cd3b0d29b80beda","d5f547b903550705"]}